  "scope": "metafieldDefinitions(ownerType) for PRODUCT, PRODUCTVARIANT, COLLECTION, PAGE, ARTICLE, BLOG and SHOP, every page (pageInfo.hasNextPage was false on each). Plus a read of the metafield namespace/key/type (no values) present on all 14 products and all 14 collections, to catch unstructured metafields that have no definition.",
  "notes": [
    "Definitions owned by other apps under reserved $app: namespaces are only visible to the owning app, so they can't appear here. Everything visible to this API client is listed.",
    "No custom.* definition exists for any owner type, and no product or collection stores a custom.* value. Every key in 04 §2 and custom.category_line is free (see collisionCheck).",
    "reviews.rating and reviews.rating_count are Shopify standard definitions holding 2 values each (brockton-mk2, 6-5-long-bristle-scrubbing-pipe-cleaners-3-cleaners). They are legacy pipe-review aggregates: never surface them (AGENTS.md: never reuse legacy pipe reviews).",
    "whatnot.* definitions (10: 8 product, 2 variant) belong to the Whatnot sales channel app; all have 0 values.",
    "pinned = pinnedPosition is not null. Shopify reports duplicate pinnedPosition values for the Whatnot definitions as returned.",
    "Metafield values were not exported (only namespace, key, type and definition link), so no product copy or review data is in this file."
  ],
